# Environment
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Large, regenerable artefacts: train_all.py rebuilds artifacts/, and every run
# writes its own logs. Downloaded data also lands under artifacts/data/.
artifacts/
logs/

# IDC ships PBMC as pbmc_x.zip (17.7 MB, kept). The unpacked npz is 2.7 GB and
# would fail GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit; it is restorable from the zip at
# any time, and this work does not use PBMC.
IDC/data/pbmc_x.npz

# Legacy single-seed results. They feed no number in the thesis and stay local
# as provenance. The exception keeps the canonical multi-seed files in -- the
# pattern would otherwise swallow results_multiseed_*.json too.
results/results_*.json
!results/results_multiseed_*.json

# Results of the four check scripts held back pending the supervisor
# discussion. The scripts write here via wpaths.results(), so moving the files
# would work against their own output path; they are withheld in place.
results/arch_check.json
results/gener_scale_check.json
results/faithfulness_masking_check.json

# The thesis' own documentation: findings log, review, figure reading guide,
# drafts, outline, paper PDFs. Only code and generated results are published
# (RESULTS_MULTISEED.md, README.md, VENDORED.md for the vendored licences).
notes/

# Superseded predecessor scripts and the pre-per-seed result state. Kept
# locally as provenance and still runnable, since they resolve the project root
# as their parent folder. The two experiments whose findings the thesis cites
# now live in the repository root.
archive/
